{"id":"b802c3dd76418d95","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-stationary.md","title":"Stationary Set","display":"df-stationary — Stationary Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-stationary","aliases":["58-df-stationary","58-df-stationary-set","Stationary Set"],"display":"df-stationary — Stationary Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-club]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-stationary"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-stationary</span><span>58-df-stationary-set</span><span>Stationary Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-stationary — Stationary Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"58-df-club\">58-df-club</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S \\subseteq \\kappa\">\\(S \\subseteq \\kappa\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\subseteq X\">\\(A \\subseteq X\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d35b78cf8312c12b\" href=\"?note=d35b78cf8312c12b\" title=\"58-df-subset\">58-df-subset</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(C\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span> (club candidate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> (正则基数谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}(S, \\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}(S, \\kappa)\\)</span> (平稳集)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Club}(C, \\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Club}(C, \\kappa)\\)</span> (闭无界)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> 是下式给出的兼容名；其条件与原 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span> 完全一致，不另加不可数性约定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary} \\vdash \\mathrm{Stationary}(S, \\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa) \\land S \\subseteq \\kappa \\land \\forall C \\subseteq \\kappa\\,(\\mathrm{Club}(C, \\kappa) \\to S \\cap C \\neq \\emptyset)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary} \\vdash \\mathrm{Stationary}(S, \\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa) \\land S \\subseteq \\kappa \\land \\forall C \\subseteq \\kappa\\,(\\mathrm{Club}(C, \\kappa) \\to S \\cap C \\neq \\emptyset)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stationary}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Stationary}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Stationary}(S,\\kappa).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>58-df-stationary-set</code> is merged here; both files defined stationarity by intersection with every club subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-club","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-club]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-subset","status":"resolved","id":"d35b78cf8312c12b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S \\subseteq \\kappa$ ($A \\subseteq X$, see [[58-df-subset]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)$ (正则基数谓词, see [[58-df-regular-cardinal]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S \\subseteq \\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"A \\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}(S, \\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Club}(C, \\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary} \\vdash \\mathrm{Stationary}(S, \\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa) \\land S \\subseteq \\kappa \\land \\forall C \\subseteq \\kappa\\,(\\mathrm{Club}(C, \\kappa) \\to S \\cap C \\neq \\emptyset)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}stationary\